  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Provincial Government in Niassa suffers from serious shortcomings in terms of financial management, as reflected in the recent audits of the Swedish contribution to the province. With the objective of improving this situation, the Embassy and Ireland provide technical assistance in form of a consultant to the province&apos;s finance department, DPPF.</narrative>
